      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the year-end statements for our manufacturing plant and I'm a bit stuck on the depreciation schedule for the new CNC milling machine we bought. Can you walk me through the straight-line depreciation calculation for me? The cost was $145,000, it has an estimated useful life of 8 years, and we expect a salvage value of $15,000 at the end of that period. Just need to make sure I'm doing the steps right for the audit trail.",
